<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Zaidi assumed direct oversight of INIS and urged the agency to be free of political quotas, while the intelligence service was ordered to stay out of party and sectarian quotas. Iranian security forces arrested 16 people over alleged terror cells in southeast Iraq, and the PMF refuted claims of paid Iranian advisers. Iraq and Syria discussed exporting two million barrels per day of oil via Baniyas port and expanding economic cooperation, linking border security talks to oil links. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPNmV0UkNkOUVxX2VVOTk2VE9KTkt4MjFfTm9tRmFLNWdYT2c5OE5rTmJHUHNReFF6dU41cGY3RW9HSkNZeGxYbExzME43Y0pKZEZxazFqcEdKYmZHZEtqRU9aZFJ1dGYyZnFqRWZfRWFUZmFncmxzN2pycEliSzBMNXotRkQ1NlFoWXRQVFdxbDk0VUp5?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE84bldkdFc4Y3dwZEdQOUluaXBtaWRfZnRSY0NITjk5RVVpSXNjdERYbjlSYzVFYUotYXRqbGFpTWNXejJZbjcyVUtqWGNySVo5cm1tSEJOOFpzRk1qc0FxNTNWOVpORnF0VmxMU20tY0lSamFzSjh0MU9vb09CbUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOVVFEb0wzdl95bU9PelZpVC02SGRuNDRuNnZjYllTZmFaQUdtUFRKVEJJVVl4NHJXdVRGMUl1eU5BTFdiY0d0Sm80TDl3Q2F3TkhRbVN5LXBNd21tWEZyVnlKanlfZVRIQzVRUzZwV1BNZEdSd3BCNlI3S1EtZm5NbmlucUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE01Y29zazQxcHNiQ1BGNWxBTndHNlI2N25YU2dXNUtDWUhXbTY3NlFIdmx0elpPX2xPNXg1ZlplemZsdzFFN0libGgtNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPcHB2SDlvTy13NFJ2dG5YMDFOSTlNeEF4azlMZnRvaXdZa0t3dVVmSTF2Rjl5bVRaR1ZheDVCbXZKNVBr